vertibird-rp-startup = begins its startup sequence, rotors whining as the engines spool.
vertibird-rp-startup-switches = clicks through banks of cockpit switches as warning lights blink across the instrument panel.
vertibird-rp-startup-avionics = brings avionics and flight controls online with a rising sequence of tones.
vertibird-rp-startup-rotors = feeds power into the twin rotors, each blade chopping faster through the air.
vertibird-rp-startup-throttle = advances the throttle as the frame shudders against the landing gear.
vertibird-rp-takeoff = lifts from the ground in a hard wash of rotor noise.
vertibird-rp-landing = settles back onto the ground as the rotors wind down.
vertibird-rp-z-up = climbs toward the sky for cruising.
vertibird-rp-z-down = descends toward the ground for ground effect flight.
